与欺辱。慕寒遥心下一沉，狠戾地盯着凤傲天，那双眸中的寒意，比千年的寒冰还冷，这等目光，不是寻常人能承受的起的。凤傲天见慕寒遥如此神情，云袖自胸前拂过，右手撑着下颚，故作闲适的打量着慕寒遥，也就在那飘浮间，慕寒遥已被解开了穴道。他腾地自地上站了起来，抽出跪在他身旁最近玑柏腰间的佩刀，深邃的眸光碎出一抹慑人心魂的冷冽寒光，脚步加快，大刀在他手中像是凝注了千金力道，步步生风，直直向凤傲天刺去。四喜见状，正欲动手，凤傲天却微微摆手，漫不经心地打量着向她刺来的肃杀之气凝重的刀光。玑柏等人见此，连忙抬眸，心中皆是一致叫嚣着，期盼慕寒遥当真能一刀将摄政王给了结了，否则，他们日后的日子更加地难过。凤傲天薄唇微抿，冷漠肃然地注视着向她袭来的慕寒遥，身手敏捷，刀法极快，力道亦是极狠，若是寻常人，必定避无可避，挨他这一刀，绝无生还的希望。但，慕寒遥如今虽然沉稳，却还是未抹掉他与生俱来的傲气，戾气虽有，不过，遇到气愤至极之事，即便再有耐心之人亦会有如此正常的举动，何况，他还是威风赫赫的将军。刀锋贯穿营帐内蕴藏已久的冰魄寒气，直冲她的心脉，凤傲天却在那刀锋只差一毫刺进她心口锦帛之处时，身形快速一闪，划过刀锋，掌心击中慕寒遥心口处，并未用内力相撞，而是手指轻捻胸口一点，在众人还未反应过来时，她已然立于慕寒遥身后，垂眸，注视着自己适才碰触过他身体的右手，玉如的手指轻轻一握，嘴角斜勾，一双冷眸划过一抹恰似回味无穷的冷笑，凉如水的声音穿透过冰封的刀锋，“慕将军的胸肌弹性极好，只是……本王不知，慕将军竟然有如此嗜好，喜欢**示人。”慕寒遥早先便知凤傲天武功高强，但，他自幼苦练，自问武功深厚，如今，看着他如此轻松自如地接下他气势如虹，杀气十足的一刀，顺带着轻薄与他，他垂眸，撇过被他碰触的胸口，似乎还有一丝冰雪般的凉意划过，若是他当真动手，如今，他已命丧黄泉。他抬眸，不解地注视着凤傲天，想着适才到现在发生的一切，他原本在采石场劳作，却被两个来历不明的黑衣人强行架走，而他被点了穴道，无法冲破，那二人身形极快，武功亦在他之上，故而，他便静观其变，思谋着这二人要将他带入何处？谁知这二人带他行至一处湖边，将他身上衣帛撕碎，直接丢入湖水中，险些被溺死，却在他即将失去知觉时，被他二人捞起，他们二人却并未打算为他穿衣，光着身子，任由着寒风划过他身无片缕的身体，强行被他们带至军营。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－嘿嘿……亲耐哒们，不好意思，因为今天素柠檬的生日，所以，更新晚鸟，么么哒！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1 Regency Storm 007 General Mu has such a hobby. The sapphire sacred ox lantern brought by the regent from the capital was specially placed in the camp. It showed solemnity, luxury and majesty. The light was bright and clearly reflected on the white light, which was extremely dazzling and bright. Feng Aotian pursed his lips slightly and lowered his eyes slightly. Only then did he remember the rules when summoning men to enter in the past. Of course, the soul did not dare to violate them. The hesitation just now was just to remind her, but she temporarily forgot about such trivial matters. Ji Bai and the others took a closer look and quickly lowered their heads. They couldn't bear to look directly and endured the severe pain of convulsions all over their bodies. They were all deeply saddened and indignant at what they saw. Mu Hanyao was the undefeated god in their hearts. They would rather be humiliated than themselves, rather than show General Mu in such an appearance. How could they face seeing General Mu again in the future? The strangeness in Feng Aotian's heart was fleeting, and she didn't think much about it. Now that it had become a fact, she wanted to see how high Mu Hanyao's ambition was, and whether he was as majestic and wise as the rumors. In the early days, she did not have a deep impression of Mu Hanyao. Except for the year when he defeated Qi Kingdom and became famous, when his master returned to the court, Feng Aotian followed the late emperor to the city gate to greet him in person. At that time, Mu Hanyao was just an immature young man. Although he was young, he acted like a young and mature man, which made her unhappy. This made her a little more disgusted with Mu Hanyao. In her eyes, except for a man as handsome as Zuo Xianhuang and as gentle as jade, no one could enter her eyes. Now, the young man has grown up. He is kneeling on the ground naked at this moment, unable to move because his acupuncture points are pressed. His bronze skin is shining with a sharp cold light due to the hidden anger. At a glance, one can see a pair of dark and deep eyes, with cold stars in them, two curved eyebrows as thick as paint, a majestic body, a majestic appearance, strong bones and muscles, and a broad chest. He has an aura that is invincible to anyone. Even the pillar that symbolizes male authority also exudes domineering power that cannot be concealed. He has a face that is even colder than hers, with sharp edges and corners, and a strong and unyielding look. Even though he is standing naked in front of everyone, he still has an impressive aura that stands like a god. Feng Aotian could imagine how majestic he would be if he were wearing a battle robe, holding a spear in his hand, and riding a tall horse. This person would be like a thousand troops standing behind him, making the enemy intimidated and fearful. Even if he doesn't say a word, he still has the majestic spirit of one man standing in front of ten thousand men. He is destined to be the feared God of War standing in this vast land. She has already made a decision in her heart. Those who follow me will prosper and those who go against me will perish. It is her good fortune to use it. If she does not follow it, she must get rid of it. Otherwise, it will be a disaster. Mu Hanyao also stared straight at Feng Aotian, who was sitting on a high position, with great anger. If he couldn't move now, he would definitely be unable to restrain himself and kill her with one knife. Of course Feng Aotian was aware of Mu Hanyao's anger, but he didn't take it seriously. He looked at his naked figure without any hindrance, and the regent's usual playful smile appeared at the corner of his mouth, \"It seems that General Mu has paid great attention to maintaining himself in the past few years. He has a good figure, but I don't know how good his hands and feet are.\" This naked ridicule made the generals who were kneeling and silently cast aside the regent in their hearts. It seemed that the regent was really tired of playing with delicate and beautiful men, and the soldiers in the camp could not meet his needs. Now, he fell in love with a tough man, but General Mu was something he could not imagine? Unless the regent really doesn't want to return to Beijing alive, even if they risk their lives to pieces, they will definitely protect General Mu and not allow him to blaspheme or insult General Mu in the slightest. Mu Hanyao's heart sank, and he stared at Feng Aotian fiercely. The coldness in his eyes was colder than thousands of years of ice. This kind of gaze was not something ordinary people could bear. Seeing Mu Hanyao's expression, Feng Aotian brushed his cloud sleeves from his chest and supported his chin with his right hand, pretending to look at Mu Hanyao leisurely. In that floating space, Mu Hanyao's acupuncture points had been unlocked. He stood up from the ground and took out the saber from Ji Bai's waist who was kneeling next to him. His deep eyes revealed a chilling light that shocked people's soul. He quickened his pace. The sword in his hand seemed to be condensed with a thousand gold's worth of strength. He stabbed straight at Feng Aotian with every step of the wind. Seeing this, Si Xi was about to take action, but Feng Aotian waved his hand slightly and casually looked at the solemn light of the sword that was stabbing at her with a murderous aura. Seeing this, Ji Bai and others quickly raised their eyes, shouting unanimously in their hearts, hoping that Mu Hanyao could really kill the regent with one blow, otherwise, their future life would be even more miserable. Feng Aotian pursed her thin lips slightly and stared indifferently and solemnly at Mu Hanyao, who was attacking her. He was agile, his sword skills were extremely fast, and his strength was extremely cruel. If he were an ordinary person, he would have no way to avoid it. If he was struck by his sword, there would be no hope of survival. However, although Mu Hanyao is calm now, he still has not erased his innate arrogance. Although he is violent, but when faced with something that makes him extremely angry, even a patient person will behave like this. What's more, he is still a majestic general. The blade of the blade penetrated the ice and cold energy that had been stored in the tent for a long time, and went straight to her heart. However, when Feng Aotian was just a hair away from piercing the brocade in her heart, Feng Aotian quickly dodged, passed the blade, and hit Mu Hanyao's heart with her palm. Instead of colliding with her internal force, she lightly pinched her chest with her fingers. Before anyone could react, she was already standing behind Mu Hanyao, lowering her eyes, watching her just touch. With his right hand across his body, Yu Ru gently grasped his fingers, hooked the corners of his mouth, and flashed a pair of cold eyes with a sneer that seemed to have endless aftertaste. A voice as cold as water penetrated the frozen blade, \"General Mu's chest muscles are extremely elastic, but... I don't know that General Mu has such a hobby and likes to show off his sex to others.\" Mu Hanyao had known that Feng Aotian's martial arts was strong, but he had practiced hard since he was a child and asked himself about martial arts.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}